    <briefdescription>
<para>A pooled allocation strategy, where each memory node has a map, each map associates a size_t with a pool of blocks of this size. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This non static version uses different pools for the different instances of the allocator </para>
